docs {
  # Batch Update Blocks
  
  Creates a new version with batch block operations: create new blocks, 
  update existing blocks, and delete blocks - all in a single atomic transaction.
  
  This is the primary way to modify profile content. Each call creates a new
  immutable version, preserving history.
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field | Type | Description |
  |-------|------|-------------|
  | `creations` | array | New blocks to create |
  | `updates` | array | Existing blocks to update |
  | `deletions` | array | Block IDs to delete (integers) |
  
  ### Creation Object
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `block_type` | string | ✅ | Type of block (see below) |
  | `data` | object | ✅ | Block-specific data |
  | `section_name` | string | ❌ | Section to place block in |
  | `sort_order` | number | ❌ | Order within section |
  
  ### Update Object
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `parent_block_id` | number | ✅ | ID of existing block to update |
  | `block_type` | string | ✅ | Type of block |
  | `data` | object | ✅ | Updated block data |
  | `section_name` | string | ❌ | Section to place block in |
  | `sort_order` | number | ❌ | Order within section |
  
  ## Block Types & Data Schemas
  
  ### work_experience
  ```json
  {
    "company_name": "required, string",
    "position_title": "required, string",
    "employment_type": "full-time|part-time|contract|internship|freelance",
    "location": "string",
    "location_type": "on-site|remote|hybrid",
    "start_date": "YYYY-MM-DD, required",
    "end_date": "YYYY-MM-DD (optional if current)",
    "is_current": "boolean, default false",
    "description": "string",
    "achievements": ["array", "of", "strings"],
    "technologies": ["array", "of", "strings"]
  }
  ```
  
  ### education
  ```json
  {
    "institution_name": "required, string",
    "degree_type": "string (e.g., Bachelor's, Master's)",
    "degree_name": "string",
    "field_of_study": "string",
    "start_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "end_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "is_current": "boolean",
    "gpa": "number 0-10",
    "gpa_scale": "number, default 4.0",
    "honors": ["array", "of", "strings"],
    "relevant_coursework": ["array", "of", "strings"]
  }
  ```
  
  ### skill
  ```json
  {
    "name": "required, string",
    "category": "required, string (e.g., Programming Languages)",
    "proficiency_level": "beginner|intermediate|advanced|expert",
    "years_experience": "number 0-100"
  }
  ```
  
  ### project
  ```json
  {
    "name": "required, string",
    "description": "string",
    "url": "valid URL",
    "repository_url": "valid URL",
    "image_url": "valid URL",
    "start_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "end_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "is_ongoing": "boolean",
    "technologies": ["array"],
    "highlights": ["array"]
  }
  ```
  
  ### certification
  ```json
  {
    "name": "required, string",
    "issuing_organization": "required, string",
    "credential_id": "string",
    "credential_url": "valid URL",
    "issue_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "expiration_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "does_not_expire": "boolean"
  }
  ```
  
  ### language
  ```json
  {
    "language": "required, string",
    "proficiency": "native|fluent|professional|intermediate|basic"
  }
  ```
  
  ### volunteer
  ```json
  {
    "organization_name": "required, string",
    "role": "required, string",
    "cause": "string",
    "start_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "end_date": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "is_current": "boolean",
    "description": "string",
    "highlights": ["array"]
  }
  ```
  
  ### award
  ```json
  {
    "title": "required, string",
    "issuer": "string",
    "date_received": "YYYY-MM-DD",
    "description": "string",
    "url": "valid URL"
  }
  ```
  
  ## Response (200 OK)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "Version updated successfully",
    "data": {
      "version": {
        "id": 6,
        "version_number": 6,
        "created_at": "2024-01-16T15:00:00Z"
      },
      "created_blocks": [101, 102],
      "updated_blocks": [42],
      "deleted_blocks": [15, 16]
    }
  }
  ```
}
